<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:normal"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:
Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;
mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:
minor-latin">Hello <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[client
name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">Welcome again
to Insperity – we're excited you’ve joined us and are looking forward to our
partnership. I’m providing some tips and tricks below to help you become
familiar with the Insperity Premier™ Portal at <a href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fportal.insperity.com%2Fcs%2Fnsp%2Findex&amp;data=02%7C01%7CJaime.Churchill%40insperity.com%7C930bacdd0aa74edbd5d408d8357cab74%7C895d9ea7ce114131829f33f878d784b2%7C0%7C0%7C637318156848044400&amp;sdata=BPHrBw7j9Gptbykf%2B1BcKGaOuvb685yVc%2BpzPxmu7kc%3D&amp;reserved=0">portal.insperity.com</a>&nbsp;and who to contact with any questions or challenges.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">The Insperity
Premier portal is your resource for information, forms, viewing your paystub
and making changes to your direct deposit or personal information safely and
securely.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">At the bottom
of every portal page you’ll find a&nbsp;<a href="https://portalapps.insperity.com/ContactUsNow/">Contact Us</a><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;link shown
below.<br><br></span><img border="0" width="578" height="109" src="data:image/png;base64," v:shapes="Picture_x0020_2" style="font-size: 12pt;"></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">After selecting
that link, you’ll see the phone number and email address for the Insperity
Contact Center. For those who prefer a live chat, there is also a ‘Chat Now”
option. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><b><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></b><img border="0" width="515" height="166" src="data:image/png;base64," v:shapes="Picture_x0020_1" style="font-size: 12pt;"></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">You will find
additional tabs on the page which direct you to other phone numbers you may
need in the future such as your Payroll Specialist and EEO Hotline.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">Instructional
videos and guides are available in the <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/need_help">Need Help</a>&nbsp;link a<span style="mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">t the
bottom of any web page</span>. These guides assist on topics such as benefits
enrollment, payroll, reporting and other important topics.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal">As always,
please let me know if I can be of assistance.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height:normal"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-fareast">Sincerely,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:red">[use email signature block]</span><o:p></o:p></p>]]></td>
